  "bench_e2e": {
    "description": "End-to-end SQL-driven 2/6 Gbp benchmark. bioseq via bioseq.load + SELECT mmsearch; minimap2 via CLI on the split FASTA. no_index = build counted; just_index = build excluded. Forces block-aligner SIMD + SIMD DP chaining + the selected minimizer GUC on the bioseq path.",
